### Acceptable Use and Telegram Terms of Service Notice

This tool is designed strictly for authorized personal data migration, channel archiving,
content management, and administrative backups between channels and groups where the operator
has legitimate permissions.

By using this software, you agree to:
1. Comply fully with the Telegram Terms of Service (https://telegram.org/tos) and API Terms.
2. Refrain from using this tool for spam, unauthorized message scraping, unconsented data collection,
   harassment, copyright infringement, or intellectual property violation.
3. Respect rate limits and Telegram flood control limits (FloodWait errors).
4. Operate solely within boundaries of legal and privacy frameworks in your jurisdiction.

The authors and contributors accept no liability for any misuse, account suspensions,
or data loss resulting from operation of this software.
